        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1202735a-0216-4305-ad76-ab59e469561f).Image",
        "Description": "(Finley Henry) is a chef who has catered and cooked at events for numerous parties on the Isle of Sgail.  His cuisines are to die for both figuratively and literally speaking. He has gotten away with so many crimes you can lose count.  One of his staff decided that it was time for him and his associates to pay for their evil deeds. We have been hired to be the answer to this poisonous problem.. Good Luck!!!",
